WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:22.490
N'ime akpa nwa, nwa e bu n'afọ na-ada ụda dị nro ma dị jụụ, gụnyere nke ha

2
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:31.870
obi obi nke nne na sistem digestive na olu na ụda sitere na ụwa n'èzí. Dị ka

3
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:38.750
afọ ime na-eru n'ọkwa ikpeazụ ya, anya nwa ọhụrụ nwere ike imeghe n'ime akpa nwa. Ọ bụ ezie na ha enweghị ike

4
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:46.950
ma hụ ihe oyiyi ma ọ bụ nkọwa, ha nwere ike ịhụ mgbanwe na ìhè. Ya mere, mgbe ndụ n'ime afọ na-mkpu

5
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:56.840
na inyoghi inyoghi, ọ dị anya na-agba nkịtị. Ọmụmụ bụ nnukwu mgbanwe maka nwa ọhụrụ. Ha na-abanye na mberede

6
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:03.820
ụwa juputara na ọhụụ ọhụrụ, na-egbuke egbuke na ụda olu. Ịgbanwe na ụwa ọhụrụ a bụ mmetụta uche

7
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:10.340
edemede nke na-amalite mmepe ha. N'ime izu ole na ole mbụ nke ndụ, nwa ahụ ga-eme

8
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.200
maa jijiji wee teta ma ọ bụrụ na enwere oke ụda. Anya ha na-enwe mmetụta maka ọkụ na-egbuke egbuke.

9
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:25.330
ma ha ka nwere ike ịhụ ntakịrị. Otú ọ dị, ọhụụ ha na-amalite ịmalite n'ụzọ dị egwu

10
00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:33.240
ọnụego. N'ime izu abụọ, ọhụụ emeela nke ọma. Ha nwere ike ịhụ nkọwa ụfọdụ, ọkachasị

11
00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:39.780
ọ bụrụ na ihe dị nso. Enweghị agba, ihe ha na-ahụ dịkwa larịị n'ihi na anya ha

12
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:45.880
adịghị ka mgbe niile kwụ ọtọ ma na-arụkọ ọrụ ọnụ maka omimi nghọta. Mgbe ụfọdụ anya ha

13
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:52.730
ga-esi n'ime ma ọ bụ pụta nwa oge. A na-akpọ nke a squinting. Nke a kwesịrị ịkwụsị ime

14
00:01:52.730 --> 00:02:00.340
site na onwa ato. N'ime otu ọnwa, ọhụụ agba na-amalite ịmalite. Ha ga-adị ukwuu

15
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:06.160
mmasị na-ahụ anya karị, karịsịa na ihu. Ha ga-amalitekwa ịgbalị iso ihe

16
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:13.030
na-akpụ akpụ. Ha ga-amatawanye ụda ndị a ma ama, gụnyere ndị ama ama

17
00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:19.450
olu, dị ka ezinụlọ ha, wee malite isonyere ihe ha nụrụ na ihe ha

18
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:24.820
hụ. N'ime ọnwa atọ, anya ha kwesịrị ịdị ogologo ma na-arụkọ ọrụ ọnụ ịmepụta

19
00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:31.620
Ọhụụ 3D. Nghọta omimi ọhụrụ a na-enyere ha aka iru ihe n'ụzọ ziri ezi. Ha

20
00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:37.240
ga-enwe ike iso ihe na-aga ngwa ngwa. N'otu oge ahụ, ụda bara uru

21
00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:45.420
ga-amalite ime. N'ime ọnwa isii, nwa ọhụrụ ahụ ga-enwe ike ịmata ndị ọ maara nke ọma

22
00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:50.960
site na ma ihu ha na olu ha. Ha nwekwara ike ịmalite ịhụ ihe ndị ọzọ

23
00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:57.880
pụọ. N'ịbụ ndị ọchịchọ ịmata ihe na-akpali ha, ha ga-eru maka ihe, ragharịa n'ebe ha nọ, na, gburugburu

24
00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:03.760
ụbọchị ọmụmụ ha mbụ, ije. Ụda ha na-etolite ma ụda ga-abụ nke mbụ

25
00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:13.460
okwu n'oge a kwa. N'ime ọnwa 18, ọhụụ na-adị ka okenye, ọ bụ ezie na ọ ka dị

26
00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:20.520
ntakịrị oghom. Ha ga-enwekwa ike ịmata aha ha ugbu a ma na-eji ọtụtụ okwu eme ihe.

27
00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:28.300
Ụfọdụ ụmụ ọhụrụ nwere ike ha agaghị emeli n'oge a tụrụ anya ha. Enwere

28
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:34.210
ọtụtụ ihe kpatara nke a, ọtụtụ ga-agbazikwa onwe ha. Dịka ọmụmaatụ, ụmụ ọhụrụ akabeghị aka

29
00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:40.920
nwere ike na-egbu oge, ma na-enwetakarị ma emechaa na nwata. Maka ụfọdụ, enwere ike ịdịgide

30
00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:47.710
ihe isi ike. Ịmata ndị a ozugbo enwere ike inye ọgwụgwọ na nkwado nwere ike

31
00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.210
bulie mmepe.
